+// The door and trade fixture (profile trade_party; a server kill and restart
+// between its two halves, -ServerKill / -ServerRestartAfter, no publication
+// requested after the trades so the restart replays the `trade` records):
+//   door       (the first run) p2 is placed at Sidorovich's bunker door and
+//              uses it (take_use_object): the installed ph_door logic opens
+//              it on the server and the joint drive goes to every client
+//   trade      both placed at Sidorovich; p1 opens a talk and the trade
+//              (take_talk_start, take_trade_open: the price table); p2's talk
+//              is refused busy (33) and p2's trade open not-talking (34); p1
+//              buys the cheapest affordable item of the stock and sells one
+//              of its own tradeable items (two trade records); p1 closes
+//   recovered  (the restarted server) the two trades were replayed from the
+//              journal (trade-replayed); p1's money is the recorded after
+const u32 kTradeFixtureOpBase = 0xF1D0000;
